WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.276
Beej se nanha sprout

2
00:00:03.276 --> 00:00:54.881
Ek beej chhota hota hai, par uske andar naya plant shuru karne ki sambhaavna hoti hai. Jab beej ko sahi nami, hawa aur temperature milta hai, to germination shuru ho sakti hai. Beej ka outer cover naram hota hai, root pehle bahar aa sakti hai aur neeche grow karne lagti hai. Phir shoot upar ki taraf badhta hai. Chhoti leaves nikalne lagti hain.

3
00:00:54.881 --> 00:01:49.761
Moong ka sprout ek familiar example hai. Is process ko sirf adult ke saath, clean container mein observe karo. Beej ko saaf geele cotton ya tissue par rakho, par use paani mein dubo kar mat chhodo. Har din dekho ki kya badla: cover, root, shoot aur leaves. Observation likho; plant ko kheenchkar bahar mat nikalo. Germination ka speed har beej aur condition mein alag ho sakta hai.

4
00:01:49.761 --> 00:02:57.747
Kya beej ko andhere mein forever rakhna chahiye? Sprout shuru hone ke baad growing plant ko roshni ki zaroorat hoti hai. Paani bhi chahiye, lekin bahut zyada paani se hawa kam mil sakti hai. Isliye balance aur observation important hain. Beej ka har sprout ek hi din mein nahi aata. Recap: moisture, air aur suitable warmth germination mein madad karte hain; root neeche aur shoot upar grow karte hain; phir leaves dikhai deti hain. Apni observation se plant growth ki chhoti diary banao.

5
00:02:57.747 --> 00:03:05.939
Suitable moisture, air aur warmth germination mein madad karte hain.

6
00:03:05.939 --> 00:03:14.949
Nanha root aam taur par neeche aur shoot upar badhta hai.

7
00:03:14.949 --> 00:03:22.321
Sprout ko clean aur adult-supervised tareeke se observe karo.

8
00:03:22.321 --> 00:03:36.246
Germination mein kis cheez ki zaroorat hoti hai? In suitable conditions mein beej sprout kar sakta hai.

9
00:03:36.246 --> 00:03:48.532
Nanha root kis taraf grow karta hai? Root aam taur par neeche grow karti hai.

10
00:03:48.532 --> 00:04:00.000
Sprout observation kaise karein? Safe, clean observation beej ko damage kiye bina dekhti hai.
